{'type': 'messages', 'ns': ('tools:eb503023-f409-43b2-066e-29b3f540c20b',), 'data': (AIMessageChunk(content='。坑杀秦卒固然出于对秦军反复无常的警惕（秦军确有半途叛逃之兆），但手段之残忍仍令天下', additional_kwargs={}, response_metadata={'model_provider': 'openai'}, id='lc_run--019e015a-1574-7c10-b5e3-635e4e073ee2', tool_calls=[], invalid_tool_calls=[], tool_call_chunks=[]), {'ls_integration': 'langchain_chat_model', 'lc_agent_name': 'researcher', 'versions': {'deepagents': '0.5.7'}, 'langgraph_step': 5, 'langgraph_node': 'model', 'langgraph_triggers': ('branch:to:model',), 'langgraph_path': ('__pregel_pull', 'model'), 'langgraph_checkpoint_ns': 'tools:eb503023-f409-43b2-066e-29b3f540c20b|model:78702b7c-1596-fe34-9d07-bde32ac35cd5', 'checkpoint_ns': 'tools:2cbc0d99-dffb-ae77-ae8e-c53b657bd4e0', 'ls_provider': 'openai', 'ls_model_name': 'MiniMax-M2.7', 'ls_model_type': 'chat', 'ls_temperature': None})}

{'type': 'messages', 'ns': ('tools:2cbc0d99-dffb-ae77-ae8e-c53b657bd4e0',), 'data': (AIMessageChunk(content='汉初功臣故宅，探访其遗闻轶事。\n\n**三、寻访旧迹**：至丰沛访问刘邦故里，考察楚', additional_kwargs={}, response_metadata={'model_provider': 'openai'}, id='lc_run--019e015a-67f8-7092-85a2-ff32c601bb77', tool_calls=[], invalid_tool_calls=[], tool_call_chunks=[]), {'ls_integration': 'langchain_chat_model', 'lc_agent_name': 'researcher', 'versions': {'deepagents': '0.5.7'}, 'langgraph_step': 14, 'langgraph_node': 'model', 'langgraph_triggers': ('branch:to:model',), 'langgraph_path': ('__pregel_pull', 'model'), 'langgraph_checkpoint_ns': 'tools:2cbc0d99-dffb-ae77-ae8e-c53b657bd4e0|model:db67483f-79c5-2661-00be-ccee17f96452', 'checkpoint_ns': 'tools:2cbc0d99-dffb-ae77-ae8e-c53b657bd4e0', 'ls_provider': 'openai', 'ls_model_name': 'MiniMax-M2.7', 'ls_model_type': 'chat', 'ls_temperature': None})}

{'type': 'messages', 'ns': ('tools:eb503023-f409-43b2-066e-29b3f540c20b',), 'data': (AIMessageChunk(content='寒心。屠咸阳、焚宫室则不仅摧毁了政治中心的物质基础，更令秦人民心尽失。\n\n**自尊心极', additional_kwargs={}, response_metadata={'model_provider': 'openai'}, id='lc_run--019e015a-1574-7c10-b5e3-635e4e073ee2', tool_calls=[], invalid_tool_calls=[], tool_call_chunks=[]), {'ls_integration': 'langchain_chat_model', 'lc_agent_name': 'researcher', 'versions': {'deepagents': '0.5.7'}, 'langgraph_step': 5, 'langgraph_node': 'model', 'langgraph_triggers': ('branch:to:model',), 'langgraph_path': ('__pregel_pull', 'model'), 'langgraph_checkpoint_ns': 'tools:eb503023-f409-43b2-066e-29b3f540c20b|model:78702b7c-1596-fe34-9d07-bde32ac35cd5', 'checkpoint_ns': 'tools:2cbc0d99-dffb-ae77-ae8e-c53b657bd4e0', 'ls_provider': 'openai', 'ls_model_name': 'MiniMax-M2.7', 'ls_model_type': 'chat', 'ls_temperature': None})}

{'type': 'messages', 'ns': ('tools:2cbc0d99-dffb-ae77-ae8e-c53b657bd4e0',), 'data': (AIMessageChunk(content='汉战争遗址。\n\n**四、收集典故**：搜集韩信、彭越、黥布等诸侯王的故事。\n\n这次壮游使司马', additional_kwargs={}, response_metadata={'model_provider': 'openai'}, id='lc_run--019e015a-67f8-7092-85a2-ff32c601bb77', tool_calls=[], invalid_tool_calls=[], tool_call_chunks=[]), {'ls_integration': 'langchain_chat_model', 'lc_agent_name': 'researcher', 'versions': {'deepagents': '0.5.7'}, 'langgraph_step': 14, 'langgraph_node': 'model', 'langgraph_triggers': ('branch:to:model',), 'langgraph_path': ('__pregel_pull', 'model'), 'langgraph_checkpoint_ns': 'tools:2cbc0d99-dffb-ae77-ae8e-c53b657bd4e0|model:db67483f-79c5-2661-00be-ccee17f96452', 'checkpoint_ns': 'tools:2cbc0d99-dffb-ae77-ae8e-c53b657bd4e0', 'ls_provider': 'openai', 'ls_model_name': 'MiniMax-M2.7', 'ls_model_type': 'chat', 'ls_temperature': None})}

