{'type': 'messages', 'ns': ('tools:eb503023-f409-43b2-066e-29b3f540c20b',), 'data': (AIMessageChunk(content='强与政治判断的迟钝。** 项羽是一个极度自尊的人', additional_kwargs={}, response_metadata={'model_provider': 'openai'}, id='lc_run--019e015a-1574-7c10-b5e3-635e4e073ee2', tool_calls=[], invalid_tool_calls=[], tool_call_chunks=[]), {'ls_integration': 'langchain_chat_model', 'lc_agent_name': 'researcher', 'versions': {'deepagents': '0.5.7'}, 'langgraph_step': 5, 'langgraph_node': 'model', 'langgraph_triggers': ('branch:to:model',), 'langgraph_path': ('__pregel_pull', 'model'), 'langgraph_checkpoint_ns': 'tools:eb503023-f409-43b2-066e-29b3f540c20b|model:78702b7c-1596-fe34-9d07-bde32ac35cd5', 'checkpoint_ns': 'tools:2cbc0d99-dffb-ae77-ae8e-c53b657bd4e0', 'ls_provider': 'openai', 'ls_model_name': 'MiniMax-M2.7', 'ls_model_type': 'chat', 'ls_temperature': None})}

{'type': 'messages', 'ns': ('tools:2cbc0d99-dffb-ae77-ae8e-c53b657bd4e0',), 'data': (AIMessageChunk(content='，职掌护卫侍从，虽品秩不高，但可接近皇帝，有机会参与朝政。\n\n司马迁以才华出众得到赏', additional_kwargs={}, response_metadata={'model_provider': 'openai'}, id='lc_run--019e015a-67f8-7092-85a2-ff32c601bb77', tool_calls=[], invalid_tool_calls=[], tool_call_chunks=[]), {'ls_integration': 'langchain_chat_model', 'lc_agent_name': 'researcher', 'versions': {'deepagents': '0.5.7'}, 'langgraph_step': 14, 'langgraph_node': 'model', 'langgraph_triggers': ('branch:to:model',), 'langgraph_path': ('__pregel_pull', 'model'), 'langgraph_checkpoint_ns': 'tools:2cbc0d99-dffb-ae77-ae8e-c53b657bd4e0|model:db67483f-79c5-2661-00be-ccee17f96452', 'checkpoint_ns': 'tools:2cbc0d99-dffb-ae77-ae8e-c53b657bd4e0', 'ls_provider': 'openai', 'ls_model_name': 'MiniMax-M2.7', 'ls_model_type': 'chat', 'ls_temperature': None})}

{'type': 'messages', 'ns': ('tools:eb503023-f409-43b2-066e-29b3f540c20b',), 'data': (AIMessageChunk(content='。他无法忍受任何形式的屈辱和轻视。韩生因建议他留都关中被他烹杀，陆贾进言他尚武他“不肯听”，皆可见其偏执。他对“分封”制度的执着、对“霸王”名号的追求，本质上都是贵族自尊心的体现——他需要的不是帝号，而是一个能够凌驾于诸侯之上的尊位。然而这种对自尊的过度维护，使他在政治博弈中屡屡错失良', additional_kwargs={}, response_metadata={'model_provider': 'openai'}, id='lc_run--019e015a-1574-7c10-b5e3-635e4e073ee2', tool_calls=[], invalid_tool_calls=[], tool_call_chunks=[]), {'ls_integration': 'langchain_chat_model', 'lc_agent_name': 'researcher', 'versions': {'deepagents': '0.5.7'}, 'langgraph_step': 5, 'langgraph_node': 'model', 'langgraph_triggers': ('branch:to:model',), 'langgraph_path': ('__pregel_pull', 'model'), 'langgraph_checkpoint_ns': 'tools:eb503023-f409-43b2-066e-29b3f540c20b|model:78702b7c-1596-fe34-9d07-bde32ac35cd5', 'checkpoint_ns': 'tools:2cbc0d99-dffb-ae77-ae8e-c53b657bd4e0', 'ls_provider': 'openai', 'ls_model_name': 'MiniMax-M2.7', 'ls_model_type': 'chat', 'ls_temperature': None})}

