{'type': 'messages', 'ns': ('tools:eb503023-f409-43b2-066e-29b3f540c20b',), 'data': (AIMessageChunk(content='。汉军却，为楚所挤，多杀，汉卒十余万人皆入睢水，水为之不流。”刘邦狼狈出逃，其父刘执嘉', additional_kwargs={}, response_metadata={'model_provider': 'openai'}, id='lc_run--019e015a-1574-7c10-b5e3-635e4e073ee2', tool_calls=[], invalid_tool_calls=[], tool_call_chunks=[]), {'ls_integration': 'langchain_chat_model', 'lc_agent_name': 'researcher', 'versions': {'deepagents': '0.5.7'}, 'langgraph_step': 5, 'langgraph_node': 'model', 'langgraph_triggers': ('branch:to:model',), 'langgraph_path': ('__pregel_pull', 'model'), 'langgraph_checkpoint_ns': 'tools:eb503023-f409-43b2-066e-29b3f540c20b|model:78702b7c-1596-fe34-9d07-bde32ac35cd5', 'checkpoint_ns': 'tools:2cbc0d99-dffb-ae77-ae8e-c53b657bd4e0', 'ls_provider': 'openai', 'ls_model_name': 'MiniMax-M2.7', 'ls_model_type': 'chat', 'ls_temperature': None})}

{'type': 'messages', 'ns': ('tools:2cbc0d99-dffb-ae77-ae8e-c53b657bd4e0',), 'data': (AIMessageChunk(content='与杨敞为妻，曾孙司马遗后来担任东莱太守。司马迁虽未能在生前看到《史记》的广泛传播，但其史学精神通过《史记》代代相传。\n\n---\n\n## 结语\n\n司马迁以"隐忍苟活"的悲壮姿态，完成了"究天人之际，通古今之变，成一家之言"的宏愿。《史记》不仅是一部伟大的史学巨著，更是一部不朽的文学经典。司马迁以残躯成就大业，用血泪凝成文字，其', additional_kwargs={}, response_metadata={'model_provider': 'openai'}, id='lc_run--019e015a-67f8-7092-85a2-ff32c601bb77', tool_calls=[], invalid_tool_calls=[], tool_call_chunks=[]), {'ls_integration': 'langchain_chat_model', 'lc_agent_name': 'researcher', 'versions': {'deepagents': '0.5.7'}, 'langgraph_step': 14, 'langgraph_node': 'model', 'langgraph_triggers': ('branch:to:model',), 'langgraph_path': ('__pregel_pull', 'model'), 'langgraph_checkpoint_ns': 'tools:2cbc0d99-dffb-ae77-ae8e-c53b657bd4e0|model:db67483f-79c5-2661-00be-ccee17f96452', 'checkpoint_ns': 'tools:2cbc0d99-dffb-ae77-ae8e-c53b657bd4e0', 'ls_provider': 'openai', 'ls_model_name': 'MiniMax-M2.7', 'ls_model_type': 'chat', 'ls_temperature': None})}

{'type': 'messages', 'ns': ('tools:eb503023-f409-43b2-066e-29b3f540c20b',), 'data': (AIMessageChunk(content='、妻子吕雉均被楚军俘获。此役楚军以三万击溃五十六万，歼灭汉军过半，是冷兵器', additional_kwargs={}, response_metadata={'model_provider': 'openai'}, id='lc_run--019e015a-1574-7c10-b5e3-635e4e073ee2', tool_calls=[], invalid_tool_calls=[], tool_call_chunks=[]), {'ls_integration': 'langchain_chat_model', 'lc_agent_name': 'researcher', 'versions': {'deepagents': '0.5.7'}, 'langgraph_step': 5, 'langgraph_node': 'model', 'langgraph_triggers': ('branch:to:model',), 'langgraph_path': ('__pregel_pull', 'model'), 'langgraph_checkpoint_ns': 'tools:eb503023-f409-43b2-066e-29b3f540c20b|model:78702b7c-1596-fe34-9d07-bde32ac35cd5', 'checkpoint_ns': 'tools:2cbc0d99-dffb-ae77-ae8e-c53b657bd4e0', 'ls_provider': 'openai', 'ls_model_name': 'MiniMax-M2.7', 'ls_model_type': 'chat', 'ls_temperature': None})}

{'type': 'messages', 'ns': ('tools:2cbc0d99-dffb-ae77-ae8e-c53b657bd4e0',), 'data': (AIMessageChunk(content='忍辱负重的精神、追求真理的勇气、卓越的史学见识，使其成为后世学者敬仰的典范。正如他在《报任安书》中所言：\n\n> "要', additional_kwargs={}, response_metadata={'model_provider': 'openai'}, id='lc_run--019e015a-67f8-7092-85a2-ff32c601bb77', tool_calls=[], invalid_tool_calls=[], tool_call_chunks=[]), {'ls_integration': 'langchain_chat_model', 'lc_agent_name': 'researcher', 'versions': {'deepagents': '0.5.7'}, 'langgraph_step': 14, 'langgraph_node': 'model', 'langgraph_triggers': ('branch:to:model',), 'langgraph_path': ('__pregel_pull', 'model'), 'langgraph_checkpoint_ns': 'tools:2cbc0d99-dffb-ae77-ae8e-c53b657bd4e0|model:db67483f-79c5-2661-00be-ccee17f96452', 'checkpoint_ns': 'tools:2cbc0d99-dffb-ae77-ae8e-c53b657bd4e0', 'ls_provider': 'openai', 'ls_model_name': 'MiniMax-M2.7', 'ls_model_type': 'chat', 'ls_temperature': None})}

{'type': 'messages', 'ns': ('tools:eb503023-f409-43b2-066e-29b3f540c20b',), 'data': (AIMessageChunk(content='时代最具悬殊比例的歼灭战之一。\n\n彭城之战的胜利虽然挽回了军事颓势，但并未改变战略格局。刘邦在彭城惨败后重整旗', additional_kwargs={}, response_metadata={'model_provider': 'openai'}, id='lc_run--019e015a-1574-7c10-b5e3-635e4e073ee2', tool_calls=[], invalid_tool_calls=[], tool_call_chunks=[]), {'ls_integration': 'langchain_chat_model', 'lc_agent_name': 'researcher', 'versions': {'deepagents': '0.5.7'}, 'langgraph_step': 5, 'langgraph_node': 'model', 'langgraph_triggers': ('branch:to:model',), 'langgraph_path': ('__pregel_pull', 'model'), 'langgraph_checkpoint_ns': 'tools:eb503023-f409-43b2-066e-29b3f540c20b|model:78702b7c-1596-fe34-9d07-bde32ac35cd5', 'checkpoint_ns': 'tools:2cbc0d99-dffb-ae77-ae8e-c53b657bd4e0', 'ls_provider': 'openai', 'ls_model_name': 'MiniMax-M2.7', 'ls_model_type': 'chat', 'ls_temperature': None})}

