{'type': 'messages', 'ns': ('tools:eb503023-f409-43b2-066e-29b3f540c20b',), 'data': (AIMessageChunk(content='命灌婴率五千骑追击。项羽渡过淮河时，随从骑士仅余百余人。行至阴陵（今', additional_kwargs={}, response_metadata={'model_provider': 'openai'}, id='lc_run--019e015a-1574-7c10-b5e3-635e4e073ee2', tool_calls=[], invalid_tool_calls=[], tool_call_chunks=[]), {'ls_integration': 'langchain_chat_model', 'lc_agent_name': 'researcher', 'versions': {'deepagents': '0.5.7'}, 'langgraph_step': 5, 'langgraph_node': 'model', 'langgraph_triggers': ('branch:to:model',), 'langgraph_path': ('__pregel_pull', 'model'), 'langgraph_checkpoint_ns': 'tools:eb503023-f409-43b2-066e-29b3f540c20b|model:78702b7c-1596-fe34-9d07-bde32ac35cd5', 'checkpoint_ns': 'tools:2cbc0d99-dffb-ae77-ae8e-c53b657bd4e0', 'ls_provider': 'openai', 'ls_model_name': 'MiniMax-M2.7', 'ls_model_type': 'chat', 'ls_temperature': None})}

{'type': 'messages', 'ns': ('tools:eb503023-f409-43b2-066e-29b3f540c20b',), 'data': (AIMessageChunk(content='安徽定远西北），项羽迷路，向一农夫问路，农夫指了一条错误的道路（“左”），导致项羽陷入大泽', additional_kwargs={}, response_metadata={'model_provider': 'openai'}, id='lc_run--019e015a-1574-7c10-b5e3-635e4e073ee2', tool_calls=[], invalid_tool_calls=[], tool_call_chunks=[]), {'ls_integration': 'langchain_chat_model', 'lc_agent_name': 'researcher', 'versions': {'deepagents': '0.5.7'}, 'langgraph_step': 5, 'langgraph_node': 'model', 'langgraph_triggers': ('branch:to:model',), 'langgraph_path': ('__pregel_pull', 'model'), 'langgraph_checkpoint_ns': 'tools:eb503023-f409-43b2-066e-29b3f540c20b|model:78702b7c-1596-fe34-9d07-bde32ac35cd5', 'checkpoint_ns': 'tools:2cbc0d99-dffb-ae77-ae8e-c53b657bd4e0', 'ls_provider': 'openai', 'ls_model_name': 'MiniMax-M2.7', 'ls_model_type': 'chat', 'ls_temperature': None})}

{'type': 'messages', 'ns': ('tools:2cbc0d99-dffb-ae77-ae8e-c53b657bd4e0',), 'data': (AIMessageChunk(content='。\n\n这次大规模的游历，使司马迁得以亲身接触各地风土人情、民间传说、古迹遗存和耆老旧闻。通过实地', additional_kwargs={}, response_metadata={'model_provider': 'openai'}, id='lc_run--019e015c-b4f7-7d51-828f-a6a8e530b2da', tool_calls=[], invalid_tool_calls=[], tool_call_chunks=[]), {'ls_integration': 'langchain_chat_model', 'lc_agent_name': 'researcher', 'versions': {'deepagents': '0.5.7'}, 'langgraph_step': 17, 'langgraph_node': 'model', 'langgraph_triggers': ('branch:to:model',), 'langgraph_path': ('__pregel_pull', 'model'), 'langgraph_checkpoint_ns': 'tools:2cbc0d99-dffb-ae77-ae8e-c53b657bd4e0|model:8c0fc49c-874c-1f20-c343-872630c5d324', 'checkpoint_ns': 'tools:2cbc0d99-dffb-ae77-ae8e-c53b657bd4e0', 'ls_provider': 'openai', 'ls_model_name': 'MiniMax-M2.7', 'ls_model_type': 'chat', 'ls_temperature': None})}

{'type': 'messages', 'ns': ('tools:2cbc0d99-dffb-ae77-ae8e-c53b657bd4e0',), 'data': (AIMessageChunk(content='考察，他印证了许多历史文献的记载，也发现了不少口耳相传的珍贵史料。《史记》中诸多生动鲜活的细节', additional_kwargs={}, response_metadata={'model_provider': 'openai'}, id='lc_run--019e015c-b4f7-7d51-828f-a6a8e530b2da', tool_calls=[], invalid_tool_calls=[], tool_call_chunks=[]), {'ls_integration': 'langchain_chat_model', 'lc_agent_name': 'researcher', 'versions': {'deepagents': '0.5.7'}, 'langgraph_step': 17, 'langgraph_node': 'model', 'langgraph_triggers': ('branch:to:model',), 'langgraph_path': ('__pregel_pull', 'model'), 'langgraph_checkpoint_ns': 'tools:2cbc0d99-dffb-ae77-ae8e-c53b657bd4e0|model:8c0fc49c-874c-1f20-c343-872630c5d324', 'checkpoint_ns': 'tools:2cbc0d99-dffb-ae77-ae8e-c53b657bd4e0', 'ls_provider': 'openai', 'ls_model_name': 'MiniMax-M2.7', 'ls_model_type': 'chat', 'ls_temperature': None})}

{'type': 'messages', 'ns': ('tools:2cbc0d99-dffb-ae77-ae8e-c53b657bd4e0',), 'data': (AIMessageChunk(content='描写，多源于此行的实际见闻。例如，鸿门宴的生动场景即来源于楚汉之际遗老的口述', additional_kwargs={}, response_metadata={'model_provider': 'openai'}, id='lc_run--019e015c-b4f7-7d51-828f-a6a8e530b2da', tool_calls=[], invalid_tool_calls=[], tool_call_chunks=[]), {'ls_integration': 'langchain_chat_model', 'lc_agent_name': 'researcher', 'versions': {'deepagents': '0.5.7'}, 'langgraph_step': 17, 'langgraph_node': 'model', 'langgraph_triggers': ('branch:to:model',), 'langgraph_path': ('__pregel_pull', 'model'), 'langgraph_checkpoint_ns': 'tools:2cbc0d99-dffb-ae77-ae8e-c53b657bd4e0|model:8c0fc49c-874c-1f20-c343-872630c5d324', 'checkpoint_ns': 'tools:2cbc0d99-dffb-ae77-ae8e-c53b657bd4e0', 'ls_provider': 'openai', 'ls_model_name': 'MiniMax-M2.7', 'ls_model_type': 'chat', 'ls_temperature': None})}

{'type': 'messages', 'ns': ('tools:eb503023-f409-43b2-066e-29b3f540c20b',), 'data': (AIMessageChunk(content='之中，被汉军追上。一番激战后，项羽抵达东城（今安徽定远东南）时', additional_kwargs={}, response_metadata={'model_provider': 'openai'}, id='lc_run--019e015a-1574-7c10-b5e3-635e4e073ee2', tool_calls=[], invalid_tool_calls=[], tool_call_chunks=[]), {'ls_integration': 'langchain_chat_model', 'lc_agent_name': 'researcher', 'versions': {'deepagents': '0.5.7'}, 'langgraph_step': 5, 'langgraph_node': 'model', 'langgraph_triggers': ('branch:to:model',), 'langgraph_path': ('__pregel_pull', 'model'), 'langgraph_checkpoint_ns': 'tools:eb503023-f409-43b2-066e-29b3f540c20b|model:78702b7c-1596-fe34-9d07-bde32ac35cd5', 'checkpoint_ns': 'tools:2cbc0d99-dffb-ae77-ae8e-c53b657bd4e0', 'ls_provider': 'openai', 'ls_model_name': 'MiniMax-M2.7', 'ls_model_type': 'chat', 'ls_temperature': None})}

{'type': 'messages', 'ns': ('tools:2cbc0d99-dffb-ae77-ae8e-c53b657bd4e0',), 'data': (AIMessageChunk(content='，萧何月下追韩信的故事亦采自民间传闻。\n\n### 3. 壮游的影响\n\n这次壮游对司马迁的精神气质与学术格局', additional_kwargs={}, response_metadata={'model_provider': 'openai'}, id='lc_run--019e015c-b4f7-7d51-828f-a6a8e530b2da', tool_calls=[], invalid_tool_calls=[], tool_call_chunks=[]), {'ls_integration': 'langchain_chat_model', 'lc_agent_name': 'researcher', 'versions': {'deepagents': '0.5.7'}, 'langgraph_step': 17, 'langgraph_node': 'model', 'langgraph_triggers': ('branch:to:model',), 'langgraph_path': ('__pregel_pull', 'model'), 'langgraph_checkpoint_ns': 'tools:2cbc0d99-dffb-ae77-ae8e-c53b657bd4e0|model:8c0fc49c-874c-1f20-c343-872630c5d324', 'checkpoint_ns': 'tools:2cbc0d99-dffb-ae77-ae8e-c53b657bd4e0', 'ls_provider': 'openai', 'ls_model_name': 'MiniMax-M2.7', 'ls_model_type': 'chat', 'ls_temperature': None})}

{'type': 'messages', 'ns': ('tools:2cbc0d99-dffb-ae77-ae8e-c53b657bd4e0',), 'data': (AIMessageChunk(content='产生了深刻影响。他亲身体验了祖国壮美的山川大地，感受了不同地域的文化差异，积累了丰富的一手素材。更重要的是，游', additional_kwargs={}, response_metadata={'model_provider': 'openai'}, id='lc_run--019e015c-b4f7-7d51-828f-a6a8e530b2da', tool_calls=[], invalid_tool_calls=[], tool_call_chunks=[]), {'ls_integration': 'langchain_chat_model', 'lc_agent_name': 'researcher', 'versions': {'deepagents': '0.5.7'}, 'langgraph_step': 17, 'langgraph_node': 'model', 'langgraph_triggers': ('branch:to:model',), 'langgraph_path': ('__pregel_pull', 'model'), 'langgraph_checkpoint_ns': 'tools:2cbc0d99-dffb-ae77-ae8e-c53b657bd4e0|model:8c0fc49c-874c-1f20-c343-872630c5d324', 'checkpoint_ns': 'tools:2cbc0d99-dffb-ae77-ae8e-c53b657bd4e0', 'ls_provider': 'openai', 'ls_model_name': 'MiniMax-M2.7', 'ls_model_type': 'chat', 'ls_temperature': None})}

{'type': 'messages', 'ns': ('tools:eb503023-f409-43b2-066e-29b3f540c20b',), 'data': (AIMessageChunk(content='，身边仅余二十八骑。\n\n此时，项羽面对绝境，展现出惊人的军事才能。他将二十八骑分为四队，分别向四个方向突围，约定在山东三处会合。他对随从说：“今日固决死，愿为诸君快战，必三胜之，为诸君溃围，斩将，刈旗，令诸君知天亡我，非战之罪也。”说罢，项羽率二十八骑呼啸而下，斩杀汉军骑将一人，击溃汉军追骑，复又', additional_kwargs={}, response_metadata={'model_provider': 'openai'}, id='lc_run--019e015a-1574-7c10-b5e3-635e4e073ee2', tool_calls=[], invalid_tool_calls=[], tool_call_chunks=[]), {'ls_integration': 'langchain_chat_model', 'lc_agent_name': 'researcher', 'versions': {'deepagents': '0.5.7'}, 'langgraph_step': 5, 'langgraph_node': 'model', 'langgraph_triggers': ('branch:to:model',), 'langgraph_path': ('__pregel_pull', 'model'), 'langgraph_checkpoint_ns': 'tools:eb503023-f409-43b2-066e-29b3f540c20b|model:78702b7c-1596-fe34-9d07-bde32ac35cd5', 'checkpoint_ns': 'tools:2cbc0d99-dffb-ae77-ae8e-c53b657bd4e0', 'ls_provider': 'openai', 'ls_model_name': 'MiniMax-M2.7', 'ls_model_type': 'chat', 'ls_temperature': None})}

{'type': 'messages', 'ns': ('tools:2cbc0d99-dffb-ae77-ae8e-c53b657bd4e0',), 'data': (AIMessageChunk(content='历使其视野从书本知识拓展至现实社会，形成了“读万卷书，行万里路”的治学理念，这一理念贯穿于《史记', additional_kwargs={}, response_metadata={'model_provider': 'openai'}, id='lc_run--019e015c-b4f7-7d51-828f-a6a8e530b2da', tool_calls=[], invalid_tool_calls=[], tool_call_chunks=[]), {'ls_integration': 'langchain_chat_model', 'lc_agent_name': 'researcher', 'versions': {'deepagents': '0.5.7'}, 'langgraph_step': 17, 'langgraph_node': 'model', 'langgraph_triggers': ('branch:to:model',), 'langgraph_path': ('__pregel_pull', 'model'), 'langgraph_checkpoint_ns': 'tools:2cbc0d99-dffb-ae77-ae8e-c53b657bd4e0|model:8c0fc49c-874c-1f20-c343-872630c5d324', 'checkpoint_ns': 'tools:2cbc0d99-dffb-ae77-ae8e-c53b657bd4e0', 'ls_provider': 'openai', 'ls_model_name': 'MiniMax-M2.7', 'ls_model_type': 'chat', 'ls_temperature': None})}

{'type': 'messages', 'ns': ('tools:eb503023-f409-43b2-066e-29b3f540c20b',), 'data': (AIMessageChunk(content='合三处骑士，杀汉军数百人。项羽亦身被十余创。\n\n### 乌江亭长\n\n项羽抵达乌江（今安徽和县', additional_kwargs={}, response_metadata={'model_provider': 'openai'}, id='lc_run--019e015a-1574-7c10-b5e3-635e4e073ee2', tool_calls=[], invalid_tool_calls=[], tool_call_chunks=[]), {'ls_integration': 'langchain_chat_model', 'lc_agent_name': 'researcher', 'versions': {'deepagents': '0.5.7'}, 'langgraph_step': 5, 'langgraph_node': 'model', 'langgraph_triggers': ('branch:to:model',), 'langgraph_path': ('__pregel_pull', 'model'), 'langgraph_checkpoint_ns': 'tools:eb503023-f409-43b2-066e-29b3f540c20b|model:78702b7c-1596-fe34-9d07-bde32ac35cd5', 'checkpoint_ns': 'tools:2cbc0d99-dffb-ae77-ae8e-c53b657bd4e0', 'ls_provider': 'openai', 'ls_model_name': 'MiniMax-M2.7', 'ls_model_type': 'chat', 'ls_temperature': None})}

{'type': 'messages', 'ns': ('tools:eb503023-f409-43b2-066e-29b3f540c20b',), 'data': (AIMessageChunk(content='东北长江岸）时，乌江亭长已备船待渡。亭长对项羽说：“江东虽小，地方千里，众数十万人，亦足王也', additional_kwargs={}, response_metadata={'model_provider': 'openai'}, id='lc_run--019e015a-1574-7c10-b5e3-635e4e073ee2', tool_calls=[], invalid_tool_calls=[], tool_call_chunks=[]), {'ls_integration': 'langchain_chat_model', 'lc_agent_name': 'researcher', 'versions': {'deepagents': '0.5.7'}, 'langgraph_step': 5, 'langgraph_node': 'model', 'langgraph_triggers': ('branch:to:model',), 'langgraph_path': ('__pregel_pull', 'model'), 'langgraph_checkpoint_ns': 'tools:eb503023-f409-43b2-066e-29b3f540c20b|model:78702b7c-1596-fe34-9d07-bde32ac35cd5', 'checkpoint_ns': 'tools:2cbc0d99-dffb-ae77-ae8e-c53b657bd4e0', 'ls_provider': 'openai', 'ls_model_name': 'MiniMax-M2.7', 'ls_model_type': 'chat', 'ls_temperature': None})}

{'type': 'messages', 'ns': ('tools:2cbc0d99-dffb-ae77-ae8e-c53b657bd4e0',), 'data': (AIMessageChunk(content='》写作的始终。\n\n---\n\n## 三、仕途经历\n\n### 1. 郎中\n\n司马迁初入仕途，约在三十岁左右被任为郎中。郎', additional_kwargs={}, response_metadata={'model_provider': 'openai'}, id='lc_run--019e015c-b4f7-7d51-828f-a6a8e530b2da', tool_calls=[], invalid_tool_calls=[], tool_call_chunks=[]), {'ls_integration': 'langchain_chat_model', 'lc_agent_name': 'researcher', 'versions': {'deepagents': '0.5.7'}, 'langgraph_step': 17, 'langgraph_node': 'model', 'langgraph_triggers': ('branch:to:model',), 'langgraph_path': ('__pregel_pull', 'model'), 'langgraph_checkpoint_ns': 'tools:2cbc0d99-dffb-ae77-ae8e-c53b657bd4e0|model:8c0fc49c-874c-1f20-c343-872630c5d324', 'checkpoint_ns': 'tools:2cbc0d99-dffb-ae77-ae8e-c53b657bd4e0', 'ls_provider': 'openai', 'ls_model_name': 'MiniMax-M2.7', 'ls_model_type': 'chat', 'ls_temperature': None})}

{'type': 'messages', 'ns': ('tools:eb503023-f409-43b2-066e-29b3f540c20b',), 'data': (AIMessageChunk(content='。愿大王急渡。今独臣有船，汉军至，无以渡。”项羽在此刻说出了一段著名的表白：“天之亡我，我何渡', additional_kwargs={}, response_metadata={'model_provider': 'openai'}, id='lc_run--019e015a-1574-7c10-b5e3-635e4e073ee2', tool_calls=[], invalid_tool_calls=[], tool_call_chunks=[]), {'ls_integration': 'langchain_chat_model', 'lc_agent_name': 'researcher', 'versions': {'deepagents': '0.5.7'}, 'langgraph_step': 5, 'langgraph_node': 'model', 'langgraph_triggers': ('branch:to:model',), 'langgraph_path': ('__pregel_pull', 'model'), 'langgraph_checkpoint_ns': 'tools:eb503023-f409-43b2-066e-29b3f540c20b|model:78702b7c-1596-fe34-9d07-bde32ac35cd5', 'checkpoint_ns': 'tools:2cbc0d99-dffb-ae77-ae8e-c53b657bd4e0', 'ls_provider': 'openai', 'ls_model_name': 'MiniMax-M2.7', 'ls_model_type': 'chat', 'ls_temperature': None})}

{'type': 'messages', 'ns': ('tools:2cbc0d99-dffb-ae77-ae8e-c53b657bd4e0',), 'data': (AIMessageChunk(content='中是汉代宫廷中的低级官职，属郎中令统辖，负责护卫宫殿、随侍皇帝。虽然品', additional_kwargs={}, response_metadata={'model_provider': 'openai'}, id='lc_run--019e015c-b4f7-7d51-828f-a6a8e530b2da', tool_calls=[], invalid_tool_calls=[], tool_call_chunks=[]), {'ls_integration': 'langchain_chat_model', 'lc_agent_name': 'researcher', 'versions': {'deepagents': '0.5.7'}, 'langgraph_step': 17, 'langgraph_node': 'model', 'langgraph_triggers': ('branch:to:model',), 'langgraph_path': ('__pregel_pull', 'model'), 'langgraph_checkpoint_ns': 'tools:2cbc0d99-dffb-ae77-ae8e-c53b657bd4e0|model:8c0fc49c-874c-1f20-c343-872630c5d324', 'checkpoint_ns': 'tools:2cbc0d99-dffb-ae77-ae8e-c53b657bd4e0', 'ls_provider': 'openai', 'ls_model_name': 'MiniMax-M2.7', 'ls_model_type': 'chat', 'ls_temperature': None})}

{'type': 'messages', 'ns': ('tools:2cbc0d99-dffb-ae77-ae8e-c53b657bd4e0',), 'data': (AIMessageChunk(content='秩不高，但作为皇帝的亲近之臣，郎中可以参与朝会、出使四方，有机会接触帝国最高层的政治', additional_kwargs={}, response_metadata={'model_provider': 'openai'}, id='lc_run--019e015c-b4f7-7d51-828f-a6a8e530b2da', tool_calls=[], invalid_tool_calls=[], tool_call_chunks=[]), {'ls_integration': 'langchain_chat_model', 'lc_agent_name': 'researcher', 'versions': {'deepagents': '0.5.7'}, 'langgraph_step': 17, 'langgraph_node': 'model', 'langgraph_triggers': ('branch:to:model',), 'langgraph_path': ('__pregel_pull', 'model'), 'langgraph_checkpoint_ns': 'tools:2cbc0d99-dffb-ae77-ae8e-c53b657bd4e0|model:8c0fc49c-874c-1f20-c343-872630c5d324', 'checkpoint_ns': 'tools:2cbc0d99-dffb-ae77-ae8e-c53b657bd4e0', 'ls_provider': 'openai', 'ls_model_name': 'MiniMax-M2.7', 'ls_model_type': 'chat', 'ls_temperature': None})}

{'type': 'messages', 'ns': ('tools:eb503023-f409-43b2-066e-29b3f540c20b',), 'data': (AIMessageChunk(content='为！且籍与江东子弟八千人渡江而西，今无一人还，纵江东父兄怜而王我，我何面目见之？', additional_kwargs={}, response_metadata={'model_provider': 'openai'}, id='lc_run--019e015a-1574-7c10-b5e3-635e4e073ee2', tool_calls=[], invalid_tool_calls=[], tool_call_chunks=[]), {'ls_integration': 'langchain_chat_model', 'lc_agent_name': 'researcher', 'versions': {'deepagents': '0.5.7'}, 'langgraph_step': 5, 'langgraph_node': 'model', 'langgraph_triggers': ('branch:to:model',), 'langgraph_path': ('__pregel_pull', 'model'), 'langgraph_checkpoint_ns': 'tools:eb503023-f409-43b2-066e-29b3f540c20b|model:78702b7c-1596-fe34-9d07-bde32ac35cd5', 'checkpoint_ns': 'tools:2cbc0d99-dffb-ae77-ae8e-c53b657bd4e0', 'ls_provider': 'openai', 'ls_model_name': 'MiniMax-M2.7', 'ls_model_type': 'chat', 'ls_temperature': None})}

{'type': 'messages', 'ns': ('tools:2cbc0d99-dffb-ae77-ae8e-c53b657bd4e0',), 'data': (AIMessageChunk(content='运作与社会生活。司马迁在郎中任上，曾随汉武帝多次巡游各地，包括北巡朔方、登泰山', additional_kwargs={}, response_metadata={'model_provider': 'openai'}, id='lc_run--019e015c-b4f7-7d51-828f-a6a8e530b2da', tool_calls=[], invalid_tool_calls=[], tool_call_chunks=[]), {'ls_integration': 'langchain_chat_model', 'lc_agent_name': 'researcher', 'versions': {'deepagents': '0.5.7'}, 'langgraph_step': 17, 'langgraph_node': 'model', 'langgraph_triggers': ('branch:to:model',), 'langgraph_path': ('__pregel_pull', 'model'), 'langgraph_checkpoint_ns': 'tools:2cbc0d99-dffb-ae77-ae8e-c53b657bd4e0|model:8c0fc49c-874c-1f20-c343-872630c5d324', 'checkpoint_ns': 'tools:2cbc0d99-dffb-ae77-ae8e-c53b657bd4e0', 'ls_provider': 'openai', 'ls_model_name': 'MiniMax-M2.7', 'ls_model_type': 'chat', 'ls_temperature': None})}

{'type': 'messages', 'ns': ('tools:eb503023-f409-43b2-066e-29b3f540c20b',), 'data': (AIMessageChunk(content='纵彼不言，籍独不愧于心乎？”\n\n这段话集中体现了项羽的贵族意识和自尊逻辑。他将失败归之于天命，以此', additional_kwargs={}, response_metadata={'model_provider': 'openai'}, id='lc_run--019e015a-1574-7c10-b5e3-635e4e073ee2', tool_calls=[], invalid_tool_calls=[], tool_call_chunks=[]), {'ls_integration': 'langchain_chat_model', 'lc_agent_name': 'researcher', 'versions': {'deepagents': '0.5.7'}, 'langgraph_step': 5, 'langgraph_node': 'model', 'langgraph_triggers': ('branch:to:model',), 'langgraph_path': ('__pregel_pull', 'model'), 'langgraph_checkpoint_ns': 'tools:eb503023-f409-43b2-066e-29b3f540c20b|model:78702b7c-1596-fe34-9d07-bde32ac35cd5', 'checkpoint_ns': 'tools:2cbc0d99-dffb-ae77-ae8e-c53b657bd4e0', 'ls_provider': 'openai', 'ls_model_name': 'MiniMax-M2.7', 'ls_model_type': 'chat', 'ls_temperature': None})}

{'type': 'messages', 'ns': ('tools:eb503023-f409-43b2-066e-29b3f540c20b',), 'data': (AIMessageChunk(content='维护自己的尊严；他拒绝渡江，并非因为惧怕，而是因为“无面目见江东父兄”。这是一种至死不改的骄傲。他以“八千人', additional_kwargs={}, response_metadata={'model_provider': 'openai'}, id='lc_run--019e015a-1574-7c10-b5e3-635e4e073ee2', tool_calls=[], invalid_tool_calls=[], tool_call_chunks=[]), {'ls_integration': 'langchain_chat_model', 'lc_agent_name': 'researcher', 'versions': {'deepagents': '0.5.7'}, 'langgraph_step': 5, 'langgraph_node': 'model', 'langgraph_triggers': ('branch:to:model',), 'langgraph_path': ('__pregel_pull', 'model'), 'langgraph_checkpoint_ns': 'tools:eb503023-f409-43b2-066e-29b3f540c20b|model:78702b7c-1596-fe34-9d07-bde32ac35cd5', 'checkpoint_ns': 'tools:2cbc0d99-dffb-ae77-ae8e-c53b657bd4e0', 'ls_provider': 'openai', 'ls_model_name': 'MiniMax-M2.7', 'ls_model_type': 'chat', 'ls_temperature': None})}

{'type': 'messages', 'ns': ('tools:2cbc0d99-dffb-ae77-ae8e-c53b657bd4e0',), 'data': (AIMessageChunk(content='封禅、巡视西南夷等重要活动。这些经历不仅拓宽了他的政治视野，也为其后来撰写相关历史篇章积累了珍贵素材。\n\n### ', additional_kwargs={}, response_metadata={'model_provider': 'openai'}, id='lc_run--019e015c-b4f7-7d51-828f-a6a8e530b2da', tool_calls=[], invalid_tool_calls=[], tool_call_chunks=[]), {'ls_integration': 'langchain_chat_model', 'lc_agent_name': 'researcher', 'versions': {'deepagents': '0.5.7'}, 'langgraph_step': 17, 'langgraph_node': 'model', 'langgraph_triggers': ('branch:to:model',), 'langgraph_path': ('__pregel_pull', 'model'), 'langgraph_checkpoint_ns': 'tools:2cbc0d99-dffb-ae77-ae8e-c53b657bd4e0|model:8c0fc49c-874c-1f20-c343-872630c5d324', 'checkpoint_ns': 'tools:2cbc0d99-dffb-ae77-ae8e-c53b657bd4e0', 'ls_provider': 'openai', 'ls_model_name': 'MiniMax-M2.7', 'ls_model_type': 'chat', 'ls_temperature': None})}

{'type': 'messages', 'ns': ('tools:eb503023-f409-43b2-066e-29b3f540c20b',), 'data': (AIMessageChunk(content='渡江而西，今无一人还”为耻，以个人的面子为重，而放弃了重整旗鼓的可能性。后人对此多有批评——认为他置八', additional_kwargs={}, response_metadata={'model_provider': 'openai'}, id='lc_run--019e015a-1574-7c10-b5e3-635e4e073ee2', tool_calls=[], invalid_tool_calls=[], tool_call_chunks=[]), {'ls_integration': 'langchain_chat_model', 'lc_agent_name': 'researcher', 'versions': {'deepagents': '0.5.7'}, 'langgraph_step': 5, 'langgraph_node': 'model', 'langgraph_triggers': ('branch:to:model',), 'langgraph_path': ('__pregel_pull', 'model'), 'langgraph_checkpoint_ns': 'tools:eb503023-f409-43b2-066e-29b3f540c20b|model:78702b7c-1596-fe34-9d07-bde32ac35cd5', 'checkpoint_ns': 'tools:2cbc0d99-dffb-ae77-ae8e-c53b657bd4e0', 'ls_provider': 'openai', 'ls_model_name': 'MiniMax-M2.7', 'ls_model_type': 'chat', 'ls_temperature': None})}

{'type': 'messages', 'ns': ('tools:eb503023-f409-43b2-066e-29b3f540c20b',), 'data': (AIMessageChunk(content='千子弟的牺牲于不顾，只考虑自己的颜面，是自私的表现。但从项羽自身的价值体系来看，这恰恰是他“宁为玉', additional_kwargs={}, response_metadata={'model_provider': 'openai'}, id='lc_run--019e015a-1574-7c10-b5e3-635e4e073ee2', tool_calls=[], invalid_tool_calls=[], tool_call_chunks=[]), {'ls_integration': 'langchain_chat_model', 'lc_agent_name': 'researcher', 'versions': {'deepagents': '0.5.7'}, 'langgraph_step': 5, 'langgraph_node': 'model', 'langgraph_triggers': ('branch:to:model',), 'langgraph_path': ('__pregel_pull', 'model'), 'langgraph_checkpoint_ns': 'tools:eb503023-f409-43b2-066e-29b3f540c20b|model:78702b7c-1596-fe34-9d07-bde32ac35cd5', 'checkpoint_ns': 'tools:2cbc0d99-dffb-ae77-ae8e-c53b657bd4e0', 'ls_provider': 'openai', 'ls_model_name': 'MiniMax-M2.7', 'ls_model_type': 'chat', 'ls_temperature': None})}

{'type': 'messages', 'ns': ('tools:2cbc0d99-dffb-ae77-ae8e-c53b657bd4e0',), 'data': (AIMessageChunk(content='2. 太史令\n\n汉武帝元封三年（公元前', additional_kwargs={}, response_metadata={'model_provider': 'openai'}, id='lc_run--019e015c-b4f7-7d51-828f-a6a8e530b2da', tool_calls=[], invalid_tool_calls=[], tool_call_chunks=[]), {'ls_integration': 'langchain_chat_model', 'lc_agent_name': 'researcher', 'versions': {'deepagents': '0.5.7'}, 'langgraph_step': 17, 'langgraph_node': 'model', 'langgraph_triggers': ('branch:to:model',), 'langgraph_path': ('__pregel_pull', 'model'), 'langgraph_checkpoint_ns': 'tools:2cbc0d99-dffb-ae77-ae8e-c53b657bd4e0|model:8c0fc49c-874c-1f20-c343-872630c5d324', 'checkpoint_ns': 'tools:2cbc0d99-dffb-ae77-ae8e-c53b657bd4e0', 'ls_provider': 'openai', 'ls_model_name': 'MiniMax-M2.7', 'ls_model_type': 'chat', 'ls_temperature': None})}

{'type': 'messages', 'ns': ('tools:eb503023-f409-43b2-066e-29b3f540c20b',), 'data': (AIMessageChunk(content='碎、不为瓦全”的贵族精神的极致体现。\n\n### 最后的战斗\n\n项羽拒绝渡江后，将坐下乌骓马赐予亭长，下', additional_kwargs={}, response_metadata={'model_provider': 'openai'}, id='lc_run--019e015a-1574-7c10-b5e3-635e4e073ee2', tool_calls=[], invalid_tool_calls=[], tool_call_chunks=[]), {'ls_integration': 'langchain_chat_model', 'lc_agent_name': 'researcher', 'versions': {'deepagents': '0.5.7'}, 'langgraph_step': 5, 'langgraph_node': 'model', 'langgraph_triggers': ('branch:to:model',), 'langgraph_path': ('__pregel_pull', 'model'), 'langgraph_checkpoint_ns': 'tools:eb503023-f409-43b2-066e-29b3f540c20b|model:78702b7c-1596-fe34-9d07-bde32ac35cd5', 'checkpoint_ns': 'tools:2cbc0d99-dffb-ae77-ae8e-c53b657bd4e0', 'ls_provider': 'openai', 'ls_model_name': 'MiniMax-M2.7', 'ls_model_type': 'chat', 'ls_temperature': None})}

{'type': 'messages', 'ns': ('tools:2cbc0d99-dffb-ae77-ae8e-c53b657bd4e0',), 'data': (AIMessageChunk(content='108年），司马迁继父职担任太史令。太史令是朝廷掌管天象历法、星象占卜及史料编纂的官职，属太常寺管辖。这是司马迁一生中最重要的仕途转折点。太史令一职既是其父司马谈的遗任，也是司马迁践行史学抱负的制度性平台。\n\n在太史令任上，司马迁得以系统地利用皇家藏书与档案资源，潜心研究上古至当世的历史文献。他“绀史记、石室', additional_kwargs={}, response_metadata={'model_provider': 'openai'}, id='lc_run--019e015c-b4f7-7d51-828f-a6a8e530b2da', tool_calls=[], invalid_tool_calls=[], tool_call_chunks=[]), {'ls_integration': 'langchain_chat_model', 'lc_agent_name': 'researcher', 'versions': {'deepagents': '0.5.7'}, 'langgraph_step': 17, 'langgraph_node': 'model', 'langgraph_triggers': ('branch:to:model',), 'langgraph_path': ('__pregel_pull', 'model'), 'langgraph_checkpoint_ns': 'tools:2cbc0d99-dffb-ae77-ae8e-c53b657bd4e0|model:8c0fc49c-874c-1f20-c343-872630c5d324', 'checkpoint_ns': 'tools:2cbc0d99-dffb-ae77-ae8e-c53b657bd4e0', 'ls_provider': 'openai', 'ls_model_name': 'MiniMax-M2.7', 'ls_model_type': 'chat', 'ls_temperature': None})}

{'type': 'messages', 'ns': ('tools:eb503023-f409-43b2-066e-29b3f540c20b',), 'data': (AIMessageChunk(content='马步战。他独自持短兵（以剑代矛）迎敌，独身杀汉军数百人，自己也受伤十余处。这时，他看见汉', additional_kwargs={}, response_metadata={'model_provider': 'openai'}, id='lc_run--019e015a-1574-7c10-b5e3-635e4e073ee2', tool_calls=[], invalid_tool_calls=[], tool_call_chunks=[]), {'ls_integration': 'langchain_chat_model', 'lc_agent_name': 'researcher', 'versions': {'deepagents': '0.5.7'}, 'langgraph_step': 5, 'langgraph_node': 'model', 'langgraph_triggers': ('branch:to:model',), 'langgraph_path': ('__pregel_pull', 'model'), 'langgraph_checkpoint_ns': 'tools:eb503023-f409-43b2-066e-29b3f540c20b|model:78702b7c-1596-fe34-9d07-bde32ac35cd5', 'checkpoint_ns': 'tools:2cbc0d99-dffb-ae77-ae8e-c53b657bd4e0', 'ls_provider': 'openai', 'ls_model_name': 'MiniMax-M2.7', 'ls_model_type': 'chat', 'ls_temperature': None})}

{'type': 'messages', 'ns': ('tools:eb503023-f409-43b2-066e-29b3f540c20b',), 'data': (AIMessageChunk(content='骑中有一旧识——吕马童。项羽说：“闻汉购我头千金，邑万户，吾为若德。”说罢，在', additional_kwargs={}, response_metadata={'model_provider': 'openai'}, id='lc_run--019e015a-1574-7c10-b5e3-635e4e073ee2', tool_calls=[], invalid_tool_calls=[], tool_call_chunks=[]), {'ls_integration': 'langchain_chat_model', 'lc_agent_name': 'researcher', 'versions': {'deepagents': '0.5.7'}, 'langgraph_step': 5, 'langgraph_node': 'model', 'langgraph_triggers': ('branch:to:model',), 'langgraph_path': ('__pregel_pull', 'model'), 'langgraph_checkpoint_ns': 'tools:eb503023-f409-43b2-066e-29b3f540c20b|model:78702b7c-1596-fe34-9d07-bde32ac35cd5', 'checkpoint_ns': 'tools:2cbc0d99-dffb-ae77-ae8e-c53b657bd4e0', 'ls_provider': 'openai', 'ls_model_name': 'MiniMax-M2.7', 'ls_model_type': 'chat', 'ls_temperature': None})}

{'type': 'messages', 'ns': ('tools:2cbc0d99-dffb-ae77-ae8e-c53b657bd4e0',), 'data': (AIMessageChunk(content='、金匮之书”，广泛搜罗、整理各类史料，为撰写《史记》做了充分的资料准备。\n\n### 3. 仕途特点\n\n综观', additional_kwargs={}, response_metadata={'model_provider': 'openai'}, id='lc_run--019e015c-b4f7-7d51-828f-a6a8e530b2da', tool_calls=[], invalid_tool_calls=[], tool_call_chunks=[]), {'ls_integration': 'langchain_chat_model', 'lc_agent_name': 'researcher', 'versions': {'deepagents': '0.5.7'}, 'langgraph_step': 17, 'langgraph_node': 'model', 'langgraph_triggers': ('branch:to:model',), 'langgraph_path': ('__pregel_pull', 'model'), 'langgraph_checkpoint_ns': 'tools:2cbc0d99-dffb-ae77-ae8e-c53b657bd4e0|model:8c0fc49c-874c-1f20-c343-872630c5d324', 'checkpoint_ns': 'tools:2cbc0d99-dffb-ae77-ae8e-c53b657bd4e0', 'ls_provider': 'openai', 'ls_model_name': 'MiniMax-M2.7', 'ls_model_type': 'chat', 'ls_temperature': None})}

{'type': 'messages', 'ns': ('tools:2cbc0d99-dffb-ae77-ae8e-c53b657bd4e0',), 'data': (AIMessageChunk(content='司马迁的仕途，其官职品秩始终不高，最高不过太史令、中书令之类。然而，他所承担的责任——', additional_kwargs={}, response_metadata={'model_provider': 'openai'}, id='lc_run--019e015c-b4f7-7d51-828f-a6a8e530b2da', tool_calls=[], invalid_tool_calls=[], tool_call_chunks=[]), {'ls_integration': 'langchain_chat_model', 'lc_agent_name': 'researcher', 'versions': {'deepagents': '0.5.7'}, 'langgraph_step': 17, 'langgraph_node': 'model', 'langgraph_triggers': ('branch:to:model',), 'langgraph_path': ('__pregel_pull', 'model'), 'langgraph_checkpoint_ns': 'tools:2cbc0d99-dffb-ae77-ae8e-c53b657bd4e0|model:8c0fc49c-874c-1f20-c343-872630c5d324', 'checkpoint_ns': 'tools:2cbc0d99-dffb-ae77-ae8e-c53b657bd4e0', 'ls_provider': 'openai', 'ls_model_name': 'MiniMax-M2.7', 'ls_model_type': 'chat', 'ls_temperature': None})}

{'type': 'messages', 'ns': ('tools:eb503023-f409-43b2-066e-29b3f540c20b',), 'data': (AIMessageChunk(content='乌江畔自刎而死，年仅三十岁。\n\n项羽死后，汉军将士争夺其遗体，互相残杀者数十人。最后，王翳取其', additional_kwargs={}, response_metadata={'model_provider': 'openai'}, id='lc_run--019e015a-1574-7c10-b5e3-635e4e073ee2', tool_calls=[], invalid_tool_calls=[], tool_call_chunks=[]), {'ls_integration': 'langchain_chat_model', 'lc_agent_name': 'researcher', 'versions': {'deepagents': '0.5.7'}, 'langgraph_step': 5, 'langgraph_node': 'model', 'langgraph_triggers': ('branch:to:model',), 'langgraph_path': ('__pregel_pull', 'model'), 'langgraph_checkpoint_ns': 'tools:eb503023-f409-43b2-066e-29b3f540c20b|model:78702b7c-1596-fe34-9d07-bde32ac35cd5', 'checkpoint_ns': 'tools:2cbc0d99-dffb-ae77-ae8e-c53b657bd4e0', 'ls_provider': 'openai', 'ls_model_name': 'MiniMax-M2.7', 'ls_model_type': 'chat', 'ls_temperature': None})}

{'type': 'messages', 'ns': ('tools:eb503023-f409-43b2-066e-29b3f540c20b',), 'data': (AIMessageChunk(content='头，杨喜、吕马童、吕胜、杨武各得一体。刘邦因此分封五人为列侯。刘邦以鲁公之', additional_kwargs={}, response_metadata={'model_provider': 'openai'}, id='lc_run--019e015a-1574-7c10-b5e3-635e4e073ee2', tool_calls=[], invalid_tool_calls=[], tool_call_chunks=[]), {'ls_integration': 'langchain_chat_model', 'lc_agent_name': 'researcher', 'versions': {'deepagents': '0.5.7'}, 'langgraph_step': 5, 'langgraph_node': 'model', 'langgraph_triggers': ('branch:to:model',), 'langgraph_path': ('__pregel_pull', 'model'), 'langgraph_checkpoint_ns': 'tools:eb503023-f409-43b2-066e-29b3f540c20b|model:78702b7c-1596-fe34-9d07-bde32ac35cd5', 'checkpoint_ns': 'tools:2cbc0d99-dffb-ae77-ae8e-c53b657bd4e0', 'ls_provider': 'openai', 'ls_model_name': 'MiniMax-M2.7', 'ls_model_type': 'chat', 'ls_temperature': None})}

{'type': 'messages', 'ns': ('tools:2cbc0d99-dffb-ae77-ae8e-c53b657bd4e0',), 'data': (AIMessageChunk(content='记录历史、传承文化——却是无可替代的文化使命。他始终将史官之职视为高于个人得失的神圣事业，即便', additional_kwargs={}, response_metadata={'model_provider': 'openai'}, id='lc_run--019e015c-b4f7-7d51-828f-a6a8e530b2da', tool_calls=[], invalid_tool_calls=[], tool_call_chunks=[]), {'ls_integration': 'langchain_chat_model', 'lc_agent_name': 'researcher', 'versions': {'deepagents': '0.5.7'}, 'langgraph_step': 17, 'langgraph_node': 'model', 'langgraph_triggers': ('branch:to:model',), 'langgraph_path': ('__pregel_pull', 'model'), 'langgraph_checkpoint_ns': 'tools:2cbc0d99-dffb-ae77-ae8e-c53b657bd4e0|model:8c0fc49c-874c-1f20-c343-872630c5d324', 'checkpoint_ns': 'tools:2cbc0d99-dffb-ae77-ae8e-c53b657bd4e0', 'ls_provider': 'openai', 'ls_model_name': 'MiniMax-M2.7', 'ls_model_type': 'chat', 'ls_temperature': None})}

{'type': 'messages', 'ns': ('tools:2cbc0d99-dffb-ae77-ae8e-c53b657bd4e0',), 'data': (AIMessageChunk(content='在遭受极刑之后，仍以这一使命为精神支撑，忍辱负重，完成《史记》。\n\n---\n\n## 四、受宫刑的经过', additional_kwargs={}, response_metadata={'model_provider': 'openai'}, id='lc_run--019e015c-b4f7-7d51-828f-a6a8e530b2da', tool_calls=[], invalid_tool_calls=[], tool_call_chunks=[]), {'ls_integration': 'langchain_chat_model', 'lc_agent_name': 'researcher', 'versions': {'deepagents': '0.5.7'}, 'langgraph_step': 17, 'langgraph_node': 'model', 'langgraph_triggers': ('branch:to:model',), 'langgraph_path': ('__pregel_pull', 'model'), 'langgraph_checkpoint_ns': 'tools:2cbc0d99-dffb-ae77-ae8e-c53b657bd4e0|model:8c0fc49c-874c-1f20-c343-872630c5d324', 'checkpoint_ns': 'tools:2cbc0d99-dffb-ae77-ae8e-c53b657bd4e0', 'ls_provider': 'openai', 'ls_model_name': 'MiniMax-M2.7', 'ls_model_type': 'chat', 'ls_temperature': None})}

{'type': 'messages', 'ns': ('tools:eb503023-f409-43b2-066e-29b3f540c20b',), 'data': (AIMessageChunk(content='礼将项羽葬于谷城（今山东平阴），亲自为文祭之。\n\n---\n\n## 六、历史评价与影响\n\n### 司马迁的评价\n\n司马', additional_kwargs={}, response_metadata={'model_provider': 'openai'}, id='lc_run--019e015a-1574-7c10-b5e3-635e4e073ee2', tool_calls=[], invalid_tool_calls=[], tool_call_chunks=[]), {'ls_integration': 'langchain_chat_model', 'lc_agent_name': 'researcher', 'versions': {'deepagents': '0.5.7'}, 'langgraph_step': 5, 'langgraph_node': 'model', 'langgraph_triggers': ('branch:to:model',), 'langgraph_path': ('__pregel_pull', 'model'), 'langgraph_checkpoint_ns': 'tools:eb503023-f409-43b2-066e-29b3f540c20b|model:78702b7c-1596-fe34-9d07-bde32ac35cd5', 'checkpoint_ns': 'tools:2cbc0d99-dffb-ae77-ae8e-c53b657bd4e0', 'ls_provider': 'openai', 'ls_model_name': 'MiniMax-M2.7', 'ls_model_type': 'chat', 'ls_temperature': None})}

