{'type': 'messages', 'ns': ('tools:2cbc0d99-dffb-ae77-ae8e-c53b657bd4e0',), 'data': (AIMessageChunk(content='评判的态度。他敢于批评暴君、讽刺权贵、歌颂贤良、同情弱者。即便对汉高祖刘邦，既有对其开国功', additional_kwargs={}, response_metadata={'model_provider': 'openai'}, id='lc_run--019e015c-b4f7-7d51-828f-a6a8e530b2da', tool_calls=[], invalid_tool_calls=[], tool_call_chunks=[]), {'ls_integration': 'langchain_chat_model', 'lc_agent_name': 'researcher', 'versions': {'deepagents': '0.5.7'}, 'langgraph_step': 17, 'langgraph_node': 'model', 'langgraph_triggers': ('branch:to:model',), 'langgraph_path': ('__pregel_pull', 'model'), 'langgraph_checkpoint_ns': 'tools:2cbc0d99-dffb-ae77-ae8e-c53b657bd4e0|model:8c0fc49c-874c-1f20-c343-872630c5d324', 'checkpoint_ns': 'tools:2cbc0d99-dffb-ae77-ae8e-c53b657bd4e0', 'ls_provider': 'openai', 'ls_model_name': 'MiniMax-M2.7', 'ls_model_type': 'chat', 'ls_temperature': None})}

{'type': 'messages', 'ns': ('tools:eb503023-f409-43b2-066e-29b3f540c20b',), 'data': (AIMessageChunk(content='消耗战中取得优势。\n\n---\n\n## 结语\n\n项羽的一生是一曲壮烈的英雄悲歌。他', additional_kwargs={}, response_metadata={'model_provider': 'openai'}, id='lc_run--019e015a-1574-7c10-b5e3-635e4e073ee2', tool_calls=[], invalid_tool_calls=[], tool_call_chunks=[]), {'ls_integration': 'langchain_chat_model', 'lc_agent_name': 'researcher', 'versions': {'deepagents': '0.5.7'}, 'langgraph_step': 5, 'langgraph_node': 'model', 'langgraph_triggers': ('branch:to:model',), 'langgraph_path': ('__pregel_pull', 'model'), 'langgraph_checkpoint_ns': 'tools:eb503023-f409-43b2-066e-29b3f540c20b|model:78702b7c-1596-fe34-9d07-bde32ac35cd5', 'checkpoint_ns': 'tools:2cbc0d99-dffb-ae77-ae8e-c53b657bd4e0', 'ls_provider': 'openai', 'ls_model_name': 'MiniMax-M2.7', 'ls_model_type': 'chat', 'ls_temperature': None})}

{'type': 'messages', 'ns': ('tools:2cbc0d99-dffb-ae77-ae8e-c53b657bd4e0',), 'data': (AIMessageChunk(content='业的肯定，也有对其流氓习气的如实刻画；对汉武帝，既记录其文治武功，也直书其穷兵', additional_kwargs={}, response_metadata={'model_provider': 'openai'}, id='lc_run--019e015c-b4f7-7d51-828f-a6a8e530b2da', tool_calls=[], invalid_tool_calls=[], tool_call_chunks=[]), {'ls_integration': 'langchain_chat_model', 'lc_agent_name': 'researcher', 'versions': {'deepagents': '0.5.7'}, 'langgraph_step': 17, 'langgraph_node': 'model', 'langgraph_triggers': ('branch:to:model',), 'langgraph_path': ('__pregel_pull', 'model'), 'langgraph_checkpoint_ns': 'tools:2cbc0d99-dffb-ae77-ae8e-c53b657bd4e0|model:8c0fc49c-874c-1f20-c343-872630c5d324', 'checkpoint_ns': 'tools:2cbc0d99-dffb-ae77-ae8e-c53b657bd4e0', 'ls_provider': 'openai', 'ls_model_name': 'MiniMax-M2.7', 'ls_model_type': 'chat', 'ls_temperature': None})}

{'type': 'messages', 'ns': ('tools:eb503023-f409-43b2-066e-29b3f540c20b',), 'data': (AIMessageChunk(content='出身名门，年少立志，以一介贵族后生的身份登上历史舞台，在短短数年间以超凡的军事天才推翻了不可一世的秦帝国，又在楚汉相争的漫长角力中走向最终的失败。他的身上集中了人性中最引人注目的矛盾：勇力与残暴并存，自尊与偏见同体，仁柔与杀戮交替。他以“力拔山兮气盖世”的豪迈开始，以“无面目见江东父兄”的自尊结束，中间穿插着破釜沉舟的果决、鸿门放人的犹豫、乌江谢亭长的悲壮。\n\n司马迁以“本纪”的体例为项羽作传，使其享受了与帝王同等的史学地位，这本身就是一种深刻的历史评价——项羽虽然失败了，但他的一生', additional_kwargs={}, response_metadata={'model_provider': 'openai'}, id='lc_run--019e015a-1574-7c10-b5e3-635e4e073ee2', tool_calls=[], invalid_tool_calls=[], tool_call_chunks=[]), {'ls_integration': 'langchain_chat_model', 'lc_agent_name': 'researcher', 'versions': {'deepagents': '0.5.7'}, 'langgraph_step': 5, 'langgraph_node': 'model', 'langgraph_triggers': ('branch:to:model',), 'langgraph_path': ('__pregel_pull', 'model'), 'langgraph_checkpoint_ns': 'tools:eb503023-f409-43b2-066e-29b3f540c20b|model:78702b7c-1596-fe34-9d07-bde32ac35cd5', 'checkpoint_ns': 'tools:2cbc0d99-dffb-ae77-ae8e-c53b657bd4e0', 'ls_provider': 'openai', 'ls_model_name': 'MiniMax-M2.7', 'ls_model_type': 'chat', 'ls_temperature': None})}

{'type': 'messages', 'ns': ('tools:2cbc0d99-dffb-ae77-ae8e-c53b657bd4e0',), 'data': (AIMessageChunk(content='黩武、迷信方术等过失。这种“寓论断于叙事”的笔法，赋予《史记》以超越时代的批判力量。\n\n###', additional_kwargs={}, response_metadata={'model_provider': 'openai'}, id='lc_run--019e015c-b4f7-7d51-828f-a6a8e530b2da', tool_calls=[], invalid_tool_calls=[], tool_call_chunks=[]), {'ls_integration': 'langchain_chat_model', 'lc_agent_name': 'researcher', 'versions': {'deepagents': '0.5.7'}, 'langgraph_step': 17, 'langgraph_node': 'model', 'langgraph_triggers': ('branch:to:model',), 'langgraph_path': ('__pregel_pull', 'model'), 'langgraph_checkpoint_ns': 'tools:2cbc0d99-dffb-ae77-ae8e-c53b657bd4e0|model:8c0fc49c-874c-1f20-c343-872630c5d324', 'checkpoint_ns': 'tools:2cbc0d99-dffb-ae77-ae8e-c53b657bd4e0', 'ls_provider': 'openai', 'ls_model_name': 'MiniMax-M2.7', 'ls_model_type': 'chat', 'ls_temperature': None})}

{'type': 'messages', 'ns': ('tools:eb503023-f409-43b2-066e-29b3f540c20b',), 'data': (AIMessageChunk(content='足以与任何帝王比肩。他在历史上的分量，不在于他赢得了天下，而在于他输掉的方式本身已成为一种永恒的典范。在中国历史的长河', additional_kwargs={}, response_metadata={'model_provider': 'openai'}, id='lc_run--019e015a-1574-7c10-b5e3-635e4e073ee2', tool_calls=[], invalid_tool_calls=[], tool_call_chunks=[]), {'ls_integration': 'langchain_chat_model', 'lc_agent_name': 'researcher', 'versions': {'deepagents': '0.5.7'}, 'langgraph_step': 5, 'langgraph_node': 'model', 'langgraph_triggers': ('branch:to:model',), 'langgraph_path': ('__pregel_pull', 'model'), 'langgraph_checkpoint_ns': 'tools:eb503023-f409-43b2-066e-29b3f540c20b|model:78702b7c-1596-fe34-9d07-bde32ac35cd5', 'checkpoint_ns': 'tools:2cbc0d99-dffb-ae77-ae8e-c53b657bd4e0', 'ls_provider': 'openai', 'ls_model_name': 'MiniMax-M2.7', 'ls_model_type': 'chat', 'ls_temperature': None})}

{'type': 'messages', 'ns': ('tools:2cbc0d99-dffb-ae77-ae8e-c53b657bd4e0',), 'data': (AIMessageChunk(content=' 4. 文学特点\n\n《史记》不仅是一部伟大的史学著作，也是卓越的文学作品。\n\n**人物塑造**：司马迁善用典型事件、细节描写和个性化语言刻画', additional_kwargs={}, response_metadata={'model_provider': 'openai'}, id='lc_run--019e015c-b4f7-7d51-828f-a6a8e530b2da', tool_calls=[], invalid_tool_calls=[], tool_call_chunks=[]), {'ls_integration': 'langchain_chat_model', 'lc_agent_name': 'researcher', 'versions': {'deepagents': '0.5.7'}, 'langgraph_step': 17, 'langgraph_node': 'model', 'langgraph_triggers': ('branch:to:model',), 'langgraph_path': ('__pregel_pull', 'model'), 'langgraph_checkpoint_ns': 'tools:2cbc0d99-dffb-ae77-ae8e-c53b657bd4e0|model:8c0fc49c-874c-1f20-c343-872630c5d324', 'checkpoint_ns': 'tools:2cbc0d99-dffb-ae77-ae8e-c53b657bd4e0', 'ls_provider': 'openai', 'ls_model_name': 'MiniMax-M2.7', 'ls_model_type': 'chat', 'ls_temperature': None})}

